Here’s a safe and structured Overpass API query tailored for the user:

---

### 🔒 Overpass Query (Safe for Public Use)

Run this script in [Overpass Turbo](https://overpass-turbo.eu/) or via a POST request to their endpoint:

```overpass
[out:json][timeout:90];
area[name="Southern Province"][admin_level=4]->.searchArea;

// Streets/roads classified as primary, secondary, tertiary, unclassified, or residential
(
  way["highway"~"^(primary|secondary|tertiary|unclassified|residential)$"]
    ["name"](area.searchArea);
);

// Output basic info including name and geometry
out body;
>;
out skel qt;
```

---

### 🧾 What This Returns:
Each row contains:
- Name (`tags.name`)
- Highway type (e.g., `residential`)
- OSM ID
- Node/Way coordinates (after converting)

Example JSON snippet:
